<%- include('header') %><section class="narrow"><a class="back" href="/dashboard">← My prompts</a><p class="eyebrow">BRING YOUR EXISTING PROMPTS</p><h1>Import from your Sheet.</h1><p class="muted">In Google Sheets, choose File → Download → Comma-separated values (.csv). Use columns named <code>keyword</code>, <code>title</code>, <code>prompt</code>.</p><% if(error) { %><p class="alert" role="alert"><%= error %></p><% } %><form class="card stack" method="post" action="/dashboard/import"><label>Choose a CSV file<input type="file" id="csv-file" accept=".csv,text/csv"></label><label>Or paste CSV text<textarea id="csv-text" name="csv" rows="10" required maxlength="900000" placeholder='keyword,title,prompt&#10;saree,Shadowed Saree Elegance,"Your complete prompt"'><%= csv %></textarea></label><p class="muted">Up to 100 rows per import, under 1 MB. All imports start as drafts. Duplicate keywords are rejected; existing prompts are never overwritten.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Import as drafts</button></form></section><%- include('footer') %>
